{"path":".agents/skills/comprehende/references/export.md","ref":"c93429c344e61d4d4c5eaa1fe1a573547253be84","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"cf1b6f04c4b41e0e3246d6f78432f82241d29e36","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793572644,"line":1,"text":"# Export"},{"sha":"cf1b6f04c4b41e0e3246d6f78432f82241d29e36","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793572644,"line":2,"text":""},{"sha":"c93429c344e61d4d4c5eaa1fe1a573547253be84","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793573659,"line":3,"text":"Write a static site and put that folder where the user asked. `<cli>` is the CLI command SKILL.md uses."},{"sha":"cf1b6f04c4b41e0e3246d6f78432f82241d29e36","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793572644,"line":4,"text":""},{"sha":"cf1b6f04c4b41e0e3246d6f78432f82241d29e36","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793572644,"line":5,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"cf1b6f04c4b41e0e3246d6f78432f82241d29e36","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793572644,"line":6,"text":"<cli> export --data \"$REVIEW_DIR/review.json\" --out \"$EXPORT_DIR\""},{"sha":"cf1b6f04c4b41e0e3246d6f78432f82241d29e36","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793572644,"line":7,"text":"```"},{"sha":"cf1b6f04c4b41e0e3246d6f78432f82241d29e36","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793572644,"line":8,"text":""},{"sha":"cf1b6f04c4b41e0e3246d6f78432f82241d29e36","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793572644,"line":9,"text":"`$EXPORT_DIR` is a fresh directory outside the work tree, not a git repository. The folder is the UI plus frozen git payloads. There is no git in it. If `review.json` is still a draft, finish the Workflow through validate, then export. Done when the user has the URL or path they named."}]}
